<title>USA: Versa completes Eder acquisition.</title>
<headline>Versa completes Eder acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Versa Technologies Inc said Wednesday it has completed its acquisition of Eder Industries Inc.</p>
<p>Versa said it paid an undisclosed amount of cash for 100 percent of the capital stock of the company.</p>
<p>Eder, a privately held company based in Oak Creek, Wis., provides custom electronic products for original equipment manufacturers.  Eder had sales of $18.6 million for its fiscal year ended August 31, 1996.  The company employs 180 people at two manufacturing plants.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
